SIGN BEFORE ANYONE BUILDS ANYTHING
In exchange for the agreed consideration, [Contributor] hereby irrevocably assigns to Sleiman Youssef Dagher all worldwide right, title, and interest — including all copyrights and other intellectual-property rights — in any work, code, design, text, music, or material created for or contributed to SYD OMEGA 91717. [Contributor] agrees to keep all non-public information confidential and to sign any documents reasonably needed to perfect this assignment.
C.3  User-content licence (for your Terms)
FOR PLATFORM TERMS
Members retain ownership of content they submit, and grant SYD OMEGA 91717 a non-exclusive, worldwide, royalty-free licence to host, display, and use that content for the purpose of operating and promoting the platform. All platform intellectual property remains the exclusive property of the owner; members receive only a limited, revocable licence to use the service.
 
